Package: tabverify
Type: Package
Title: Independent TrialAgentBench Property Verification
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Segal", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bradley.segal@wolfson.ox.ac.uk")
Description: Reconstructs declared trial analyses and parameter falsification
    tests from released tables, and independently recomputes declared benchmark
    scores without importing generation or scoring code.
